    "body": "Oh interesting, I'd never thought of this particular case.\r\n\r\nDo you know if there's some environment variable that gets set when a prompt is redrawn vs when it's doing a fresh draw after some command? I suppose we could abuse preexec and precmd to write something like this ourselves, but the zsh init framework is somewhat fragile as it stands.",
